From: plotarmordev <299844489+plotarmordev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:40:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 57/57] docs: the silence guard's floor leaves whispered and
 soft speech alone, measured

Eleven renders in a cloned voice and the built-in voice (whisper, soft, a quietly prefix, sighs, a bedtime story, speech
turning into a whisper) all ended stop: the longest run below -40 dBFS inside speech was 2.51 s, and every 10 s held a
frame at -34.8 dBFS or louder. The one trip, the built-in voice asked to speak quietly, was a collapse into a hum:
cut at 10.63 s after one word, where the live build hummed on for 97.85 s.
---
 CHANGELOG.md         | 2 +-
 docs/drama-voices.md | 3 ++-
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

